{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MoonMiners is a cooperative survival simulator set in a dystopian future where you play as space miners working for a ruthless megacorporation, far from Earth. Completing your job might just be harder than staying alive - and that\u2019s saying something.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/0605-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654880\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As part of a mining crew, your mission is to complete a quota made up of various objectives. But danger lurks in every task: random threats, hostile environments, and even betrayal from within the team. Sometimes the greatest threat isn\u2019t aliens - it\u2019s your clumsy, chaotic crewmates.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/06054-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654880\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restore the base, split up responsibilities, scan and analyze deposits, and follow strict corporate protocols to extract resources. Process and deliver materials while facing mounting threats - from aggressive alien lifeforms to a hidden traitor with a personal agenda: sabotage, disruption, or even assassination.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/06059-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654880\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it\u2019s poor planning, accidents, or sabotage, survival is never guaranteed. Cooperation is your best chance... but trust is optional.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/06056-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654880\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681820?t=1749654880","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681820?t=1749654880","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/4967e4da690e3d9a3dcbc1a08bb131b477f05cd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749654880","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/4967e4da690e3d9a3dcbc1a08bb131b477f05cd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749654880","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3681840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MoonMiners is a cooperative survival simulator set in a dystopian future where you play as space miners working for a ruthless megacorporation, far from Earth. Completing your job might just be harder than staying alive - and that\u2019s saying something.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/0605-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654880\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As part of a mining crew, your mission is to complete a quota made up of various objectives. But danger lurks in every task: random threats, hostile environments, and even betrayal from within the team. Sometimes the greatest threat isn\u2019t aliens - it\u2019s your clumsy, chaotic crewmates.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681820/extras/06054-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654880\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restore the base, split up responsibilities, scan and analyze deposits, and follow strict corporate protocols to extract resources. Process and deliver materials while facing mounting threats - from aggressive alien li